Can you take it off.  Cursed armor can still reduce your AC, but
you can't take it off.

I think you said you had your pet.  Use it to verify that the
armor isn't cursed before trying it on.  And try on everything
you can that isn't cursed---getting your AC down is probably the
single most important thing to do in the early game.  (Later,
when it's down between -5/-10, other advantages, either weight
or magic properties, can be more important than getting it one
more level lower.  But you do want to be somewhere between -5
and -10 as quickly as possible.)

